      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 18:1)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia agachaaka kogamba ekero arenge nemiaka emerongo ebere, na etano, na akagamba emiaka emerongo ebere, na kianda, agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Abiya, omosubati o Zakaria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia agakora ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene koreng’ana buna aya onsi Daudi, sokoro yaye, akorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogochenwa gwe Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi bw’eritang’ani, ase omwaka bw’eritang’ani bw’okogamba gwa Hezekia, akaigora ebisieri bi’enyomba y’Omonene, naende akabiroisia bikaba ebiyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarenta abakuani na Abalawi, akabasangereria amo agwo ase eraaro, ensemo ya moocha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabateebia, “Inwe Abalawi, inyigwere! Bono inwe echene, naende mochene enyomba y’Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaino, morusie korwa ase Obomenyo obo Obochenu kera egento kebokorete bokaba obotachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisokoro chiaito tichiabeete chinyegenwa; nigo chiakorete ayare amabe ase amaiso ’Omonene, Nyasae oito, chikamotiga. Barabwo bakaonchora amasio abo korwa ase Obomenyo bw’Omonene, bakaa Omonene amagega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagasieka ebisieri bi’enyomba yaagachire bosio bwe Hekalu yabwateranirie nero, na bakarimia chitaaya, na tibasambete ubani gose tibaruete ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ime y’Aase Aachenu, ase Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio endamwamu y’Omonene egacha igoro ase Abayuda, na ase abanto ba Yerusalemu. Omonene akabakora bakaba ebiorokererio bi’og okuurera, na aya abakorerete abeire ay’ogoichania na ay’okoondokia abanto. Aya moyaroche namaiso aino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono abatata baito baitirwe nemioro bakuure; abana baito, abamura na abaiseke, na abakungu baito bairirwe obosomba ase engencho y’ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono nigo kore okogania kwane ng’a nkore okobwatana kw’ogotianania n’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, erinde endamwamu yaye entindi etotige.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana baane, timobaisa koba abakoombia, ekiagera Omonene obachorire mobe mogotenena ase obosio bwaye momokorere; inwe mobe abasomba baye, momosambere ubani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abalawi aba bakaimoka: Mahati, mosinto bw’Amasai, na Yoel, mosinto bw’Asaria, be chiamate chi’Abakohati; na korwa ase chiamate chia Merari: Kisi, mosinto bw’Abidi, na Asaria, mosinto o Yehaleleli; na korwa ase chiamate chia Gerisoni: Yoa, mosinto o Sima, na Edeni, mosinto o Yoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase chiamate chi’Elisafani; Simuri na Yeieli; na korwa ase chiamate chi’Asafu: Zakaria na Matania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na korwa ase chiamate chia Hemani: Yehieli na Simei; na korwa ase chiamate chia Yedutuni: Semaya na Usieli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi aba bagasangereria abanto bamwabo, erio bonsi bagechena, bagasoa ase enyomba y’Omonene bakayechena buna omorwoti konya arure ogochika koreng’ana ne ring’ana ri’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani bagasoa ase chinsemo chia ime kegima chi’enyomba y’Omonene, bakayechena. Bagasokia korwa imeo ebinto bionsi biakorete Hekalu y’Omonene ekaba eyetachenegeti goikera ase eraaro, na korwa aroro Abalawi bakabibogoria bakabiira goika ase rikura ria Kidironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko rie ritang’ani, omotienyi bw’eritang’ani, bagachaaka gochena Hekalu, na ase rituko ria gatano na gatato ri’omotienyi oyio bagaikera enyomba yaagachire bosio bw’enyomba y’Omonene na yabwateranirie nero. Naende bagasoa bakaba bagochena enyomba y’Omonene ase engaki y’amatuko atano na atato, na ase rituko ria ikomi na gatano, na rimo, ri’omotienyi oyio bw’eritang’ani bagakoora emeremo eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hekalu egwatananwa na gochenwa naende",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagenda ase Hezekia omorwoti, bakamoteebia, “Twachenire enyomba yonsi y’Omonene, na egesasiimero gi’okoruera ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa, amo nebikorero biaye bionsi, na emesa y’emegati ekoruegwa ase Nyasae amo nebikorero biaye bionsi bi’emesa eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikorero bionsi biria Ahasi omorwoti atugutete na akabianga ekero arenge kogamba, ekiagera tabeete omwegenwa ase Omonene, twabiroisirie na kobichena. Rora, nao bire agwo bosio bw’egesasiimero ki’Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hezekia omorwoti akaimoka mambia chuni, agasangereria abanene b’omochie, na barabwo bagatiira kogenda gochia ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaira chieri isano na ibere, ne chimingichi isano na ibere, ne chimanwa chi’eching’ondi isano na ibere, ne chigoree isano na ibere, chibe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe ase engencho y’oborwoti, na Hekalu, na Abayuda. Agachiika abakuani ab’ororeria rwa Aroni bachirue ase egesasiimero ki’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanyenya chieri chiria, na abakuani bakaimokia amanyinga e chieri echio, bakayaumora ase egesasiimero; naende bakanyenya chimingichi chiria, na amanyinga e chimingichi echio naro bakayaumora ase egesasiimero. Magega y’ayio bakanyenya chimanwa chiria chi’eching’ondi na amanyinga e chimanwa echio naro akaumorwa ase egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakarenta chigoree chiria chi’ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe ase omorwoti na ase omosangererekano, na barabwo bakabeeka amaboko abo igoro ase emetwe ye chigoree echio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani bagachinyenya, na amanyinga e chigoree echio bakayaumora ase egesasiimero akaba ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe ase okobwatania Abaisraeli bonsi na Nyasae. Omorwoti nigo achigete ng’a ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa na eki’ebibe biruegwe ase engencho y’Abaisraeli bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enyomba y’Omonene omorwoti akabeeka Abalawi barenge goakania chisani chikwoga, na amakano, na amakano ’ebirigisa, koreng’ana nogochika kwa Nyasae goetera ase Daudi, na Gadi omoorori bw’omorwoti, na Nathani omobani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi bagatenena babwate ebinto bi’okobugigwa bia Daudi, na abakuani babwate ebitureeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hezekia agachiika ng’a ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa keruegwe ase egesasiimero. Ekero ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa giachaagete koruegwa, abanto bagachaaka goterera Omonene; na ababugia ebitureeri bakabibugia bakoraagwa n’ebinto bi’okobugigwa bia Daudi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omosangererekano bwonsi ogasasiima, na abateri bagatera, na ababugia ebitureeri bakabibugia ase amariogi amanene; bakagenderera goika okoruegwa gw’ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa kogakoorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero okoruegwa gw’ekeng’wanso gwakoorirwe, omorwoti amo nabaanto bonsi barenge amo nere bagekumba, bagasasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia omorwoti amo nabagaambi b’oborwoti bagachika Abalawi batere amatera ay’ogotogia Omonene ase amang’ana a Daudi na ay’Asafu omoorori. Barabwo bagatera, bakaba bagotogia nomogooko, bagekumba na gosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hezekia agateebia abanto “Bono mwatananirwe ase Omonene na gochenwa. Inchuo ang’e, renta ebing’wanso bi’okonyenywa, na ebi’omorembe ase enyomba y’Omonene.” Omosangererekano okarenta ebing’wanso biria, na baria barenge ne chinkoro chi’ogwancha, bakarenta ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omobaro bw’ebing’wanso biria omosangererekano orentete nigo orenge chieri emerongo etano na ebere, ne chimingichi rigana erimo, ne chimanwa chi’eching’ondi amagana abere. Echio chionsi nigo chiaruetwe chikaba ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebing’wanso biatananetwe nigo biarenge chieri amagana atano na rimo, ne ching’ondi chilifu isano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abakuani nigo barenge abake mono, na tibanyarete korusia amasankwa korwa ase ching’iti chiria chionsi chianyenyetwe chikaba ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa. Ase ayio Abalawi bamwabo bakabakonya goika emeremo eria ekaera, na goika abakuani bande bakaba bachenekire. Abalawi bakaba ne chinkoro chindonge kobua abakuani ase ogwechena abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa nigo biarenge ebinge, na amo nebio ebitinya bi’ebing’wanso bi’omorembe, na okoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa gochikiire koruegwa amo na birobio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Na igo obokoreri ase enyomba y’Omonene bokaba bokoroberigwa buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia amo nabaanto bonsi bakaba nomogooko ase ayio Nyasae akorerete abanto, ekiagera nigo abairanerete ase obwango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
